    "text": "grantcountyherald.com\nwebsite\nMinnesota\nCreating New Financial Support For Our Schools\n11 hours ago\nLast year, seven school districts in the state operated with a four-day school week. For the coming school year, those numbers have risen to 12. More are now applying for consideration of moving to a four-day school week, including the Benson district. Why eliminate a day of school a week...",
